# const pair = { left: 1 }; take(pair.left)
# What was stored is left out of what a read finds. The read then has a receiver and no value, and nothing says why it should never complete: the build stops and names the read.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: pipeline AnalyzeFlow
# OPTIONS: sabotage=StoredValuesAreNeverRead
# DIAGNOSTIC: OperationWithoutValue 1
# PROGRAM-OF: an-operation-whose-operands-hold-values-holds-one.ir
